# flatpak

A component imported from the collection this repository publishes

## Where it is built

example

## Which variant it builds

`example` builds variant `beta`.

## How its options are set

| Build | Option | Set by | Value |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `example` | `remotes` | `beta` | sets "flathub", "flathub-beta" |
| `example` | `system-wide` | `example` | sets #false |

